{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU SURVIVE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Southbound is an open world roguelike survival game, fight agains hordes of monsters on randomly generated maps inspired by South American landscapes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE YOUR BUILD</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/d148bdcb05116314df6e5b1a2fcebe80.poster.avif?t=1767148806\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/d148bdcb05116314df6e5b1a2fcebe80.webm?t=1767148806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/d148bdcb05116314df6e5b1a2fcebe80.mp4?t=1767148806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick XP from enemies to level up and get new equipment to help you survive for longer. Each run is unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE START ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in a handcrafted island, one of the last survival outposts. Here you can buy equipment, ammo, and talk to the locals and prepare for your journey to the wild continent. You can go back there at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6ef32e8aee322c40331e7c1284d82567.poster.avif?t=1767148806\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6ef32e8aee322c40331e7c1284d82567.webm?t=1767148806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6ef32e8aee322c40331e7c1284d82567.mp4?t=1767148806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can leave the island whenever you want and explore the randomly generated continent. Nature reclaimed most of the land but you can still find gear, resources and some lone survivors to chat with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's multiple biomes from north to south, from the driest desert in the world in the north to ice sheets in the south.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/f76a2b0725d803d05a047e2cbf162de5.avif?t=1767148806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras_big/f76a2b0725d803d05a047e2cbf162de5.avif?t=1767148806 width=1600 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781420?t=1767148806","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781420?t=1767148806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/dc46998318862b7f4cc622b889fff763549eec8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767148806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/dc46998318862b7f4cc622b889fff763549eec8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767148806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There's player vs monsters violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU SURVIVE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Southbound is an open world roguelike survival game, fight agains hordes of monsters on randomly generated maps inspired by South American landscapes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE YOUR BUILD</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/d148bdcb05116314df6e5b1a2fcebe80.poster.avif?t=1767148806\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/d148bdcb05116314df6e5b1a2fcebe80.webm?t=1767148806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/d148bdcb05116314df6e5b1a2fcebe80.mp4?t=1767148806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick XP from enemies to level up and get new equipment to help you survive for longer. Each run is unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE START ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in a handcrafted island, one of the last survival outposts. Here you can buy equipment, ammo, and talk to the locals and prepare for your journey to the wild continent. You can go back there at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6ef32e8aee322c40331e7c1284d82567.poster.avif?t=1767148806\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6ef32e8aee322c40331e7c1284d82567.webm?t=1767148806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6ef32e8aee322c40331e7c1284d82567.mp4?t=1767148806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can leave the island whenever you want and explore the randomly generated continent. Nature reclaimed most of the land but you can still find gear, resources and some lone survivors to chat with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's multiple biomes from north to south, from the driest desert in the world in the north to ice sheets in the south.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/f76a2b0725d803d05a047e2cbf162de5.avif?t=1767148806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras_big/f76a2b0725d803d05a047e2cbf162de5.avif?t=1767148806 width=1600 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["taguagames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/aede9f4b2bd12b34c488747e13adcf6d06aade2a/header.jpg?t=1767148806","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781420/36849372/729502bf283eee0170a508503cfc2537d22caced/1766430738/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766431639","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781420/36849372/729502bf283eee0170a508503cfc2537d22caced/1766430738/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766431639","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781420/36849372/729502bf283eee0170a508503cfc2537d22caced/1766430738/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766431639","id":257238925,"name":"announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257238925/1c1bcb592d256d9c2207b49f